           an integer in NR1 format.
&lt;mask&gt; ::= following values:</pre><pre class="synopsis">Bit Weight Name Enables
--- ------ ---- ----------
 7    128  OPER Operation Status Reg
 6     64  ---- (Not used.)
 5     32  ESB  Event Status Bit
 4     16  MAV  Message Available
 3      8  ---- (Not used.)
 2      4  MSG  Message
 1      2  USR  User
 0      1  TRG  Trigger</pre></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><pre class="synopsis">n/a</pre></td><td><pre class="synopsis">*STB?</pre></td><td><pre class="synopsis">&lt;value&gt; ::= 0 to 255; an integer in NR1 format,
