{{0 | OFF} | {1 | ON}}</pre></td><td><pre class="synopsis">:WMEMory&lt;r&gt;:DISPlay?</pre></td><td><pre class="synopsis">&lt;r&gt; ::= 1-2 in NR1 format</pre><pre class="synopsis">{0 | 1}</pre></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><pre class="synopsis">:WMEMory&lt;r&gt;:LABel &lt;string&gt;</pre></td><td><pre class="synopsis">:WMEMory&lt;r&gt;:LABel?</pre></td><td><pre class="synopsis">&lt;r&gt; ::= 1-2 in NR1 format</pre><pre class="synopsis">&lt;string&gt; ::= any series of 10 or less ASCII
             characters enclosed in quotation
             marks</pre></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><pre class="synopsis">:WMEMory&lt;r&gt;:SAVE &lt;source&gt;</pre></td><td><pre class="synopsis">n/a</pre></td><td><pre class="synopsis">&lt;r&gt; ::= 1-2 in NR1 format</pre><pre class="synopsis">&lt;source&gt; ::= {CHANnel&lt;n&gt; | FUNCtion | MATH}</pre><pre class="synopsis">&lt;n&gt; ::= 1 to (# analog channels) in NR1 format</pre><pre class="synopsis">NOTE: Only ADD or SUBtract math operations can be
