&lt;range&gt;[suffix]</pre></td><td><pre class="synopsis">:WMEMory&lt;r&gt;:YRANge?</pre></td><td><pre class="synopsis">&lt;r&gt; ::= 1-2 in NR1 format</pre><pre class="synopsis">&lt;range&gt; ::= vertical full-scale range value
