            in NR3 format</pre><pre class="synopsis">[suffix] ::= {V | mV}</pre></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><br class="table-break"><div class="table"><a name="legend"></a><p class="title"><b>Table&nbsp;64.&nbsp;Command Dependencies Descriptions</b></p><div class="table-contents"><table summary="Command Dependencies Descriptions" border="1"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody valign="top"><tr><td><p><a name="threek"></a><sup>1</sup><span class="3k">3000&nbsp;X-Series</span> &#8212; requires a 3000&nbsp;X-Series oscilloscope. MSO, memory, and serial options can be added.</p><p><a name="wgn"></a><sup>2</sup><span class="wgn">WAVEGEN</span> &#8212; requires a waveform generator option. Highlighted syntax is only valid when the waveform generator option has been licensed.</p><p><a name="mso"></a><sup>3</sup><span class="mso">MSO</span> &#8212; requires a mixed-signal oscilloscope.</p><p><a name="lss"></a><sup>4</sup><span class="lss">EMBD</span> &#8212; requires the low-speed serial option.</p><p><a name="ams"></a><sup>5</sup><span class="ams">AUTO</span> &#8212; requires the automotive serial option.</p><p><a name="edu"></a><sup>6</sup><span class="edu">EDK</span> &#8212; requires the education kit option.</p><p><a name="urt"></a><sup>7</sup><span class="urt">COMP</span> &#8212; requires the RS-232/UART serial option.</p><p><a name="sgm"></a><sup>8</sup><span class="sgm">SGM</span> &#8212; requires the segmented memory option.</p><p><a name="lmt"></a><sup>9</sup><span class="lmt">MASK</span> &#8212; requires the mask test option.</p><p><a name="snd"></a><sup>10</sup><span class="snd">AUDIO</span> &#8212; requires the I2S serial option.</p><p><a name="vid"></a><sup>11</sup><span class="vid">VID</span> &#8212; requires the extended Video triggering option.</p><p><a name="flex"></a><sup>12</sup><span class="flex">FLEX</span> &#8212; requires the FlexRay serial option.</p><p><a name="aero"></a><sup>13</sup><span class="aero">AERO</span> &#8212; requires the MIL-STD&nbsp;1553 and ARINC&nbsp;429 serial option.</p><p><a name="advmath"></a><sup>14</sup><span class="advmath">ADVMATH</span> &#8212; requires the DSOX3ADVMATH advanced math measurements option.</p><p><a name="pwr"></a><sup>15</sup><span class="pwr">PWR</span> &#8212; requires the DSOX3PWR power measurement and analysis option.</p><p><a name="dvm"></a><sup>16</sup><span class="dvm">DVM</span> &#8212; requires the DSOXDVM digital voltmeter analysis option.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><br class="table-break"></div></body></html>